          },
          "worked": "The domain is $x>0$. Change to base 5.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_5(x)-\\frac{\\log_5(x)}{\\log_5(25)}&=1\\\\\\log_5(x)-\\frac12\\log_5(x)&=1\\\\\\frac12\\log_5(x)&=1\\\\\\log_5(x)&=2\\\\x&=5^2\\\\x&=25\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince $25>0$, the solution is valid.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
